4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GpRj5oLopH8Q7kNvwHxW9yG&_nc_oc=Adp-12qqyRq5XAaop28eWryq0OrPH0z0igM-Ks-1Kx_YpOANTqCj3AZa0Nt-H0SSA3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7BS9fbMFZcR1J1FW_q0VOKDq2EOEOvpFm_a82YVPplfw&oe=6A1C31D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hnjlCFDNyGMQ7kNvwHN_gXG&_nc_oc=Adp6bSdXI0i9Q4x63J5kuSTBygfj9skHWXTWG0__dt8TOVmJxxoq82fCOPLsLE_a5YQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ux9EHW6XAAUKpV3cY5SVEmIxzRz_1pKX1dKaKEO8fLQ&oe=6A1C36B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tt3ulXDcXbEQ7kNvwG6XAlb&_nc_oc=Adrn_oeEwnuj4-O-VRTAZ5d-0TB6ZBgXk0jOSaYkYTlW8uoiqZU_C6agOQOwXikSqxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5D0rrTy8yIsTS2779gJ96z_VYiVMt1tJzhRMHk6cHbow&oe=6A1C4455"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p